      "payload_json": "{\"findings\":[{\"topic\":\"read-side protocols\",\"kind\":\"decision\",\"summary\":\"Established markdown-based ticket wayfinding operations under .scratch/ requiring resolved features to post answers and map pointers to Decisions-so-far.\",\"source\":\"docs/agents/issue-tracker.md\"},{\"topic\":\"compaction behavior\",\"kind\":\"decision\",\"summary\":\"Enforces strict context budget parameters in settings.json with keepRecentTokens: 20000 and reserveTokens: 60000 to manage window size.\",\"source\":\"docs/harness-progress-summary.md\"},{\"topic\":\"compaction behavior\",\"kind\":\"measurement\",\"summary\":\"Verified that pi-tscg (tool schema compressor) and pi-context-prune (using DeepSeek) reduced the agent context footprint by 31.5% (15.6KB to 10.7KB).\",\"source\":\"docs/harness-progress-summary.md\"},{\"topic\":\"compaction behavior\",\"kind\":\"measurement\",\"summary\":\"Determined via a 27-iteration autoresearch optimization campaign that pi-tscg (-6,467 tokens) and pi-slim (-323 tokens) produce a highly load-bearing 4,007 token floor.\",\"source\":\"docs/harness-progress-summary.md\"},{\"topic\":\"compaction behavior\",\"kind\":\"open problem\",\"summary\":\"Identifying the precise mechanism behind the first-request 'warm-up' token penalty where configuration changes trigger startup overhead before cache stabilization.\",\"source\":\"docs/harness-progress-summary.md\"},{\"topic\":\"memory processors\",\"kind\":\"open problem\",\"summary\":\"Identified a silent failure where the pi-context-prune package was installed but missing from settings.json packages array, rendering its background summarization/pruning properties inactive.\",\"source\":\"docs/pi-config-analysis.md\"},{\"topic\":\"read-side protocols\",\"kind\":\"open problem\",\"summary\":\"Discovered rules/lean-ctx.md was completely inert and un-loaded because the Pi agent core lacks a 'rules' resource type and does not auto-resolve rule directories.\",\"source\":\"docs/pi-config-analysis.md\"},{\"topic\":\"compaction behavior\",\"kind\":\"open problem\",\"summary\":\"Overlapping suite of visual and text compactors (pi-slim, pi-tscg, pi-cache-optimizer, pi-smart-compact) can fight each other or disrupt stable prefixes used for prompt caching.\",\"source\":\"docs/pi-config-analysis.md\"},{\"topic\":\"session retrieval or indexing\",\"kind\":\"decision\",\"summary\":\"Loaded context-mode as an MCP plugin to provide active file pruning, custom query routing, and an FTS5 SQLite index database.\",\"source\":\"docs/pi-config-analysis.md\"},{\"topic\":\"compaction behavior\",\"kind\":\"decision\",\"summary\":\"Set compaction.reserveTokens to 60000 (vastly higher than default 16384) to trigger compaction earlier and preserve a larger response budget.\",\"source\":\"docs/pi-config-analysis.md\"},{\"topic\":\"cross-session memory\",\"kind\":\"decision\",\"summary\":\"OMP agent configuration enables cross-session memories with local sqlite backend, injecting age-filtered memories under a 2,500 token limit.\",\"source\":\"docs/pi-configuration.md\"},{\"topic\":\"memory processors\",\"kind\":\"decision\",\"summary\":\"Designed background session prune settings in context-prune/settings.json targeting deepseek-v4-flash to summarize and prune turns after agent-message events.\",\"source\":\"docs/pi-configuration.md\"},{\"topic\":\"read-side protocols\",\"kind\":\"decision\",\"summary\":\"Authored lean-ctx.md to enforce systematic read-side/search-side tool discipline, prioritizing ctx_compose and forbidding line-by-line file reading.\",\"source\":\"docs/pi-configuration.md\"},{\"topic\":\"compaction behavior\",\"kind\":\"measurement\",\"summary\":\"Quantified that loading pi-slim slashes the baseline system prompt size by 39% (saving around 18.1K input tokens).\",\"source\":\"docs/pi-configuration.md\"},{\"topic\":\"compaction behavior\",\"kind\":\"measurement\",\"summary\":\"Proxy-based wire logs verified Pi uses 60% fewer input tokens than OMP (20,369 vs 50,533) due to Pi's extremely small native system prompt size.\",\"source\":\"docs/wayfinder-agents-optimization.md\"},{\"topic\":\"session retrieval or indexing\",\"kind\":\"open problem\",\"summary\":\"FTS5 SQLite database files under context-mode content/ grow very large and bloated (34 MB for one db), requiring age-based pruning and VACUUM routines.\",\"source\":\"docs/wayfinder-agents-optimization.md\"},{\"topic\":\"session retrieval or indexing\",\"kind\":\"decision\",\"summary\":\"Executed an archive-first cleanup deleting approximately 480 transient benchmark and probe session transcripts to reduce search space clutter in the sessions directory.\",\"source\":\"docs/cleanup-report-2026-07-29.md\"}]}",
