ource' argument at index time (defaulting to 'project:<dirname>' or path) and are stored in the 'sources' table (coupled to FTS5 virtual table 'chunks' by source_id). Passing this label as the 'source' filter in ctx_search/CLI filters search results to match that specific source.\"}}"
